    "market_commentary": "The SSY Pacific Capesize Index decreased by 210 points from last week to 3,818, the lowest since 15 February 2021. SSY’s assessed W.AustraliaChina iron ore spot voyage rate has edged $0.35/t lower to $6.30/t. The round-voyage rate has dropped by $1,700/day to $2,650/day.",
